Direct ports (trimmed and adapted to DSH):
  - src/adapters/herdr/cli.ts    (CLI envelope, version floor, error mapping)
  - src/domain/version.ts        (version floor math)
  - src/domain/session.ts        (exact last-assistant extraction)
  - src/domain/launch.ts         (per-kind launch argv and naming, in spirit)
  - src/domain/aliases.ts        (alias resolution shape, in spirit)

The DSH tool adapter, ports/adapters split, topology, registry, prompt
envelopes, review loop, and harvest/diff logic are written for this package.
